<urn:epcglobal:cbv:bt:0860009999992:861-20260417-001> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/bizTransactionType> <https://ref.gs1.org/cbv/BTT-recadv> .
<urn:epcglobal:cbv:bt:0860009999992:PACK-20260418-042> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/bizTransactionType> <https://ref.gs1.org/cbv/BTT-prodorder> .
_:b241_b0 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-18T17:02:27.452Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "         and 'quantity received' KDE (quantityList)." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  TransformationEvent, bizStep=creating_class_instance, disposition=active." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  bizTransactionList = reference document type + number KDEs." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  eventTime = date of initial packing KDE." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  inputQuantityList.epcClass = upstream TLC of the raw commodity." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  outputQuantityList.epcClass = NEW TLC assigned by the packer (GTIN+Batch/Lot of the case)." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  readPoint + bizLocation = TLC source location KDE." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event 3: Receive at packer (ObjectEvent / receiving / in_progress). Records 'date received' KDE (eventTime)" .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event 6: Initial Packing itself:" .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Events 1-2: Harvest (creating_class_instance) + Transport (transporting); see harvest-cte.jsonld." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Events 4-5: Cooling (other) + Transport, optional intermediate cooling step before packing." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 US requires the packer to persist upstream Harvest and Cooling KDEs alongside its own pack event," .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Initial Packing CTE per GS1 US 'EPCIS Recommendations for FSMA 204 CTEs' R2.0, §4." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NO usfsma: extension fields ride inside the event." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "so this document carries all five events end-to-end: harvest → transport → receive → cool → transport → pack." .
_:b241_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
